<title>SINGAPORE: TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the men's Singapore</p>
<p>Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat 6-Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 7-6</p>
<p>(10-8) 7-5</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 7-Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-0 7-6</p>
<p>(9-7)</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat 4-Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Patrick Rafter</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
